1
00:02:40,840 --> 00:02:42,280
<font color="#ffffff">PREVIOUSLY</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

2
00:02:42,360 --> 00:02:43,520
<font color="#ffffff">Gotcha.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

3
00:02:44,120 --> 00:02:46,520
<font color="#ffffff">Sergeant, run a check on</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">that van's license plate.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

4
00:02:46,600 --> 00:02:48,360
<font color="#ffffff">If it was a day or two ago,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

5
00:02:48,440 --> 00:02:50,240
<font color="#ffffff">someone rented it.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

6
00:02:50,320 --> 00:02:51,640
<font color="#ffffff">I think…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

7
00:02:51,720 --> 00:02:54,000
<font color="#ffffff">It was one of Ms. Yok's hotel staff.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

8
00:02:54,080 --> 00:02:55,360
<font color="#ffffff">-Ms. Yok?</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Ms. Yok?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

9
00:02:55,440 --> 00:02:58,240
<font color="#ffffff">Then until that Boonrod of yours</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

10
00:02:58,320 --> 00:03:00,440
<font color="#ffffff">brings my diamond back…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

11
00:03:00,520 --> 00:03:03,000
<font color="#ffffff">I'm afraid I must ask you</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

12
00:03:03,080 --> 00:03:05,080
<font color="#ffffff">to stay right here.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

13
00:03:07,600 --> 00:03:09,280
<font color="#ffffff">Is this her?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

14
00:03:09,360 --> 00:03:11,000
<font color="#ffffff">The reporter?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

15
00:03:12,040 --> 00:03:14,080
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, I remember her.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

16
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:20,360
<font color="#ffffff">With so many rooms,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">how are we ever going to find him?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

17
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:25,400
<font color="#ffffff">I bet Luang Pho isn't being kept</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">in a regular room.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

18
00:03:27,800 --> 00:03:30,480
<font color="#ffffff">Look at you,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">finally starting to get that cop instinct.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

19
00:03:31,080 --> 00:03:33,760
<font color="#ffffff">What do you mean by "instinct"?</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">I am a cop.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

20
00:03:33,840 --> 00:03:35,600
<font color="#ffffff">We need to hurry</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

21
00:03:35,680 --> 00:03:37,920
<font color="#ffffff">before the police track us down.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

22
00:03:44,680 --> 00:03:46,760
<font color="#ffffff">Why are you putting your arm around me?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

23
00:03:46,840 --> 00:03:48,640
<font color="#ffffff">Just making it look natural.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

24
00:03:49,880 --> 00:03:50,720
<font color="#ffffff">Let's go.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

25
00:03:50,800 --> 00:03:53,080
<font color="#ffffff">Get your hands off me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

26
00:04:01,040 --> 00:04:02,720
<font color="#ffffff">-Hello.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Hello.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

27
00:04:02,800 --> 00:04:04,120
<font color="#ffffff">Can I help you?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

28
00:04:04,200 --> 00:04:05,400
<font color="#ffffff">Do you have any vacancies?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

29
00:04:06,080 --> 00:04:07,680
<font color="#ffffff">Just for one night.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

30
00:04:07,760 --> 00:04:08,920
<font color="#ffffff">One room for the three of us.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

31
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:11,000
<font color="#ffffff">-Three people?</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Yes.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

32
00:04:11,080 --> 00:04:13,360
<font color="#ffffff">Your name and address, please.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

33
00:04:14,680 --> 00:04:17,279
<font color="#ffffff">Here you go.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">You can check my business card.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

34
00:04:21,440 --> 00:04:23,720
<font color="#ffffff">What kind of room would you like?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

35
00:04:23,800 --> 00:04:25,800
<font color="#ffffff">We'd like your best room.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

36
00:04:25,880 --> 00:04:27,320
<font color="#ffffff">Somewhere quiet, please.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

37
00:04:27,400 --> 00:04:28,840
<font color="#ffffff">So we can have some privacy.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

38
00:04:30,400 --> 00:04:34,840
<font color="#ffffff">-How about a suite, then?</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-That works. A suite is fine.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

39
00:04:34,920 --> 00:04:36,600
<font color="#ffffff">Just a moment, please.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

40
00:04:48,800 --> 00:04:49,880
<font color="#ffffff">Oh no.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

41
00:04:59,040 --> 00:05:00,160
<font color="#ffffff">They're here.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

42
00:05:00,240 --> 00:05:02,120
<font color="#ffffff">They're here! Hurry up!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

43
00:05:02,680 --> 00:05:04,600
<font color="#ffffff">Can you speed it up, please?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

44
00:05:04,680 --> 00:05:06,120
<font color="#ffffff">My girlfriend has a stomachache.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

45
00:05:08,120 --> 00:05:09,840
<font color="#ffffff">-Yes, I do.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Here's your room key.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

46
00:05:09,920 --> 00:05:11,680
<font color="#ffffff">-Thanks.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-It's really bad!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

47
00:05:11,760 --> 00:05:13,520
<font color="#ffffff">-Right this way.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-This way?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

48
00:05:13,600 --> 00:05:15,640
<font color="#ffffff">-Let's go. Can you make it?</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Go, go.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

49
00:05:15,720 --> 00:05:18,040
<font color="#ffffff">-Hang in there.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Okay!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

50
00:05:33,560 --> 00:05:36,760
<font color="#ffffff">I thought we were done for.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

51
00:05:36,840 --> 00:05:39,840
<font color="#ffffff">I didn't expect Kan</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">to track us down this fast either.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

52
00:05:40,760 --> 00:05:44,440
<font color="#ffffff">You seem to know that cop pretty well.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

53
00:05:45,160 --> 00:05:46,360
<font color="#ffffff">Are you their informant?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

54
00:05:46,440 --> 00:05:48,640
<font color="#ffffff">No, I'm not.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

55
00:05:49,400 --> 00:05:52,120
<font color="#ffffff">Then tell us the truth.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

56
00:05:55,680 --> 00:05:56,560
<font color="#ffffff">Well…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

57
00:05:57,640 --> 00:05:58,640
<font color="#ffffff">Well?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

58
00:06:02,640 --> 00:06:03,520
<font color="#ffffff">He's…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

59
00:06:04,400 --> 00:06:05,840
<font color="#ffffff">Just…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

60
00:06:06,960 --> 00:06:08,160
<font color="#ffffff">He's my ex.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

61
00:06:09,240 --> 00:06:10,800
<font color="#ffffff">-Oh, her ex.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Ex?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

62
00:06:11,640 --> 00:06:14,200
<font color="#ffffff">But we broke up.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

63
00:06:14,280 --> 00:06:16,280
<font color="#ffffff">Then why did you break up?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

64
00:06:18,200 --> 00:06:19,320
<font color="#ffffff">I don't really know.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

65
00:06:19,400 --> 00:06:21,600
<font color="#ffffff">We just wanted different things, I guess.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

66
00:06:22,480 --> 00:06:24,840
<font color="#ffffff">But it looks like you still</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

67
00:06:24,920 --> 00:06:26,440
<font color="#ffffff">love him.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

68
00:06:28,640 --> 00:06:30,920
<font color="#ffffff">If I could control my heart,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

69
00:06:31,720 --> 00:06:33,560
<font color="#ffffff">I'd want to stop loving him too.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

70
00:06:35,800 --> 00:06:37,560
<font color="#ffffff">All right, stop doubting me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

71
00:06:38,200 --> 00:06:40,000
<font color="#ffffff">He and I are in the past.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

72
00:06:40,640 --> 00:06:42,320
<font color="#ffffff">I'm definitely on your side.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

73
00:06:44,400 --> 00:06:45,880
<font color="#ffffff">What's next?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

74
00:06:52,360 --> 00:06:53,920
<font color="#ffffff">What brings you here, officers?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

75
00:06:55,640 --> 00:06:57,760
<font color="#ffffff">We're here to search the premises.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

76
00:06:57,840 --> 00:06:59,280
<font color="#ffffff">Search?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

77
00:06:59,360 --> 00:07:00,920
<font color="#ffffff">My hotel?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

78
00:07:01,760 --> 00:07:02,840
<font color="#ffffff">On what grounds?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

79
00:07:04,520 --> 00:07:05,640
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho Suea is missing.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

80
00:07:07,160 --> 00:07:08,800
<font color="#ffffff">Our investigation shows that</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

81
00:07:08,880 --> 00:07:10,400
<font color="#ffffff">your hotel employee</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

82
00:07:11,360 --> 00:07:12,400
<font color="#ffffff">rented the vehicle</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

83
00:07:12,480 --> 00:07:13,800
<font color="#ffffff">used to abduct him.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

84
00:07:15,640 --> 00:07:16,680
<font color="#ffffff">So what?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

85
00:07:17,360 --> 00:07:20,720
<font color="#ffffff">He might have just invited him</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">for personal reasons.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

86
00:07:21,320 --> 00:07:22,680
<font color="#ffffff">It has nothing to do with me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

87
00:07:24,440 --> 00:07:26,680
<font color="#ffffff">This might be related</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">to the missing diamond.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

88
00:07:27,720 --> 00:07:29,680
<font color="#ffffff">Are you suspecting that</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

89
00:07:29,760 --> 00:07:31,920
<font color="#ffffff">I took the monk?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

90
00:07:33,720 --> 00:07:35,000
<font color="#ffffff">My apologies.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

91
00:07:37,200 --> 00:07:39,880
<font color="#ffffff">Isn't it a bit much to go as far…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

92
00:07:40,920 --> 00:07:42,200
<font color="#ffffff">as searching the hotel?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

93
00:07:42,800 --> 00:07:44,160
<font color="#ffffff">It seems</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

94
00:07:44,840 --> 00:07:46,960
<font color="#ffffff">you care more about your hotel's image</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

95
00:07:48,080 --> 00:07:50,000
<font color="#ffffff">than your own missing diamond.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

96
00:07:51,640 --> 00:07:54,000
<font color="#ffffff">I'm anxious about my diamond,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

97
00:07:54,960 --> 00:07:56,880
<font color="#ffffff">but I'm a business owner.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

98
00:07:57,800 --> 00:08:00,960
<font color="#ffffff">No business owner would let</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

99
00:08:01,960 --> 00:08:04,640
<font color="#ffffff">their reputation be ruined.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

100
00:08:05,520 --> 00:08:07,560
<font color="#ffffff">I'm just doing my duty.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

101
00:08:08,280 --> 00:08:10,040
<font color="#ffffff">Where is the search warrant?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

102
00:08:12,160 --> 00:08:13,680
<font color="#ffffff">We just want your cooperation</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

103
00:08:15,120 --> 00:08:16,720
<font color="#ffffff">to speed things up.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

104
00:08:19,520 --> 00:08:21,720
<font color="#ffffff">As a cop, you should know</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

105
00:08:21,800 --> 00:08:24,840
<font color="#ffffff">you can't search this place</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">without a warrant.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

106
00:08:31,360 --> 00:08:33,039
<font color="#ffffff">Then can we see that employee?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

107
00:08:33,840 --> 00:08:35,000
<font color="#ffffff">Which one?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

108
00:08:37,679 --> 00:08:38,559
<font color="#ffffff">This one.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

109
00:08:38,640 --> 00:08:40,039
<font color="#ffffff">He rented the van.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

110
00:08:44,360 --> 00:08:45,480
<font color="#ffffff">Bring him in.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

111
00:08:48,560 --> 00:08:50,160
<font color="#ffffff">But that employee</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

112
00:08:50,680 --> 00:08:52,160
<font color="#ffffff">left a long time ago, Ms. Yok.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

113
00:08:54,760 --> 00:08:57,120
<font color="#ffffff">Then this has nothing to do with me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

114
00:08:57,720 --> 00:08:59,880
<font color="#ffffff">Go look for him yourself.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

115
00:09:02,000 --> 00:09:03,840
<font color="#ffffff">What a waste of time.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

116
00:09:05,800 --> 00:09:07,640
<font color="#ffffff">Please leave now.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

117
00:09:22,440 --> 00:09:23,560
<font color="#ffffff">Was it Ms. Yok</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

118
00:09:23,640 --> 00:09:25,440
<font color="#ffffff">who took Luang Pho Suea?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

119
00:09:26,040 --> 00:09:27,040
<font color="#ffffff">Yeah.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

120
00:09:27,120 --> 00:09:29,600
<font color="#ffffff">She heard from the cops</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">that Chan has the diamond.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

121
00:09:29,680 --> 00:09:31,480
<font color="#ffffff">So she kidnapped the monk.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

122
00:09:32,480 --> 00:09:34,520
<font color="#ffffff">How do you know the monk is there, boss?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

123
00:09:37,000 --> 00:09:39,640
<font color="#ffffff">The boss has his connections</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">providing intel.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

124
00:09:40,280 --> 00:09:42,240
<font color="#ffffff">Why are you asking?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

125
00:09:43,000 --> 00:09:44,480
<font color="#ffffff">I'm sorry.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

126
00:09:45,600 --> 00:09:47,120
<font color="#ffffff">Have you found Chan yet?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

127
00:09:48,120 --> 00:09:49,440
<font color="#ffffff">Regarding that,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

128
00:09:49,520 --> 00:09:51,600
<font color="#ffffff">ever since he fled the forest,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

129
00:09:51,680 --> 00:09:54,160
<font color="#ffffff">our men have been looking for him.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

130
00:09:55,000 --> 00:09:56,640
<font color="#ffffff">Find him.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

131
00:09:58,800 --> 00:09:59,960
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, sir.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

132
00:10:05,360 --> 00:10:06,720
<font color="#ffffff">One more thing, Paul.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

133
00:10:07,600 --> 00:10:10,840
<font color="#ffffff">What should we do</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">about Kamnan Sawaeng's men?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

134
00:10:11,440 --> 00:10:12,800
<font color="#ffffff">They have been messing with us</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

135
00:10:12,880 --> 00:10:15,080
<font color="#ffffff">and misleading us for some time now.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

136
00:10:21,960 --> 00:10:23,320
<font color="#ffffff">Don't worry.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

137
00:10:23,400 --> 00:10:25,120
<font color="#ffffff">Someone will handle it.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

138
00:10:29,040 --> 00:10:30,080
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

139
00:10:30,800 --> 00:10:32,160
<font color="#ffffff">Are you in there?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

140
00:10:36,120 --> 00:10:37,200
<font color="#ffffff">It's locked.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

141
00:10:37,680 --> 00:10:39,240
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

142
00:10:42,960 --> 00:10:44,280
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

143
00:10:44,360 --> 00:10:45,920
<font color="#ffffff">Are you in there?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

144
00:10:50,480 --> 00:10:51,560
<font color="#ffffff">Where could he be?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

145
00:10:52,160 --> 00:10:53,880
<font color="#ffffff">How does your team operate?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

146
00:10:53,960 --> 00:10:56,160
<font color="#ffffff">If I hadn't tipped you off,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

147
00:10:56,240 --> 00:10:58,560
<font color="#ffffff">you would've been arrested for kidnapping.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

148
00:10:59,360 --> 00:11:00,480
<font color="#ffffff">I'm sorry.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

149
00:11:01,000 --> 00:11:03,040
<font color="#ffffff">My men were careless.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

150
00:11:04,360 --> 00:11:07,560
<font color="#ffffff"><i>What did you do with the employee</i></font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff"><i>who rented the van?</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font></font>

151
00:11:07,640 --> 00:11:10,120
<font color="#ffffff">I paid him a hefty sum</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

152
00:11:10,200 --> 00:11:11,760
<font color="#ffffff">to go into hiding.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

153
00:11:12,960 --> 00:11:14,520
<font color="#ffffff">Don't worry.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

154
00:11:15,760 --> 00:11:16,880
<font color="#ffffff">By the way,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

155
00:11:17,480 --> 00:11:19,400
<font color="#ffffff">your subordinate, Captain Kan,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

156
00:11:19,480 --> 00:11:21,280
<font color="#ffffff">is incredibly stubborn.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

157
00:11:21,360 --> 00:11:23,080
<font color="#ffffff">He's just doing his job.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

158
00:11:23,160 --> 00:11:24,400
<font color="#ffffff">We can't blame him.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

159
00:11:25,240 --> 00:11:28,720
<font color="#ffffff">He'll definitely</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">apply for a search warrant soon.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

160
00:11:28,800 --> 00:11:30,480
<font color="#ffffff">I can stall him for now,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

161
00:11:31,000 --> 00:11:32,800
<font color="#ffffff">but you don't have much time.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

162
00:11:32,880 --> 00:11:35,960
<font color="#ffffff">Hurry and force the diamond's location</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">out of Luang Pho.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

163
00:11:36,040 --> 00:11:37,560
<font color="#ffffff">Don't worry.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

164
00:11:38,600 --> 00:11:40,240
<font color="#ffffff">One way or another,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

165
00:11:40,320 --> 00:11:43,320
<font color="#ffffff">I'll make the monk talk soon.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

166
00:11:57,040 --> 00:11:58,000
<font color="#ffffff">Any luck?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

167
00:11:58,080 --> 00:12:00,720
<font color="#ffffff">I tricked the staff into talking,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">but nobody saw him.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

168
00:12:00,800 --> 00:12:02,360
<font color="#ffffff">They didn't see him,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

169
00:12:02,960 --> 00:12:04,560
<font color="#ffffff">or they were ordered to stay quiet?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

170
00:12:05,160 --> 00:12:07,040
<font color="#ffffff">What if he's not even here?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

171
00:12:08,160 --> 00:12:09,720
<font color="#ffffff">From my experience,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

172
00:12:10,240 --> 00:12:13,600
<font color="#ffffff">criminals always think the most</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">obvious place is the safest place.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

173
00:12:13,680 --> 00:12:16,120
<font color="#ffffff">My gut tells me he's here.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

174
00:12:18,400 --> 00:12:19,880
<font color="#ffffff">-Let's go.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Okay.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

175
00:12:29,720 --> 00:12:33,280
<font color="#ffffff">How are you going to make</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho tell us about the diamond?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

176
00:12:33,920 --> 00:12:34,840
<font color="#ffffff">Good question.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

177
00:12:35,760 --> 00:12:36,880
<font color="#ffffff">What should I do?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

178
00:12:44,000 --> 00:12:45,040
<font color="#ffffff">Do you think</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

179
00:12:45,760 --> 00:12:48,000
<font color="#ffffff">there is any man on earth</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

180
00:12:48,720 --> 00:12:51,560
<font color="#ffffff">purer than a monk</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">who strictly observes his precepts?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

181
00:12:55,360 --> 00:12:57,920
<font color="#ffffff">Overcoming a man like that</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

182
00:12:59,120 --> 00:13:01,320
<font color="#ffffff">is quite thrilling, I think.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

183
00:13:02,840 --> 00:13:04,200
<font color="#ffffff">Don't you think?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

184
00:13:04,800 --> 00:13:07,160
<font color="#ffffff">-You mean you're going to…</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Yes.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

185
00:13:09,920 --> 00:13:11,880
<font color="#ffffff">I must play my trump card…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

186
00:13:15,400 --> 00:13:16,800
<font color="#ffffff">and end this game.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

187
00:13:20,760 --> 00:13:24,280
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho, do you know</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">who's here to help us?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

188
00:13:24,920 --> 00:13:26,800
<font color="#ffffff">Junior disciple!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

189
00:13:27,600 --> 00:13:28,680
<font color="#ffffff">Okay.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

190
00:13:29,480 --> 00:13:32,160
<font color="#ffffff">Boonrod, hurry up</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

191
00:13:32,880 --> 00:13:35,040
<font color="#ffffff">before these distractions</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

192
00:13:35,120 --> 00:13:37,240
<font color="#ffffff">make me break my precepts.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

193
00:13:40,480 --> 00:13:42,280
<font color="#ffffff">Hello, Luang Pho.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

194
00:13:45,120 --> 00:13:46,160
<font color="#ffffff">Yes?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

195
00:13:46,760 --> 00:13:50,560
<font color="#ffffff">My boss ordered me to get you ready</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">and take good care of you.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

196
00:13:52,240 --> 00:13:53,680
<font color="#ffffff">Ready for what?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

197
00:13:54,400 --> 00:13:56,600
<font color="#ffffff">What is this bad guy going to do to you?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

198
00:13:57,440 --> 00:13:59,000
<font color="#ffffff">Don't worry, Luang Pho.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

199
00:13:59,080 --> 00:14:00,720
<font color="#ffffff">My boss will be here soon.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

200
00:14:00,800 --> 00:14:03,600
<font color="#ffffff">Honestly, I wish I could take your place.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

201
00:14:17,000 --> 00:14:18,640
<font color="#ffffff">If I were Yok,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

202
00:14:18,720 --> 00:14:20,960
<font color="#ffffff">I'd hide Luang Pho on the top floor.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

203
00:14:21,560 --> 00:14:22,960
<font color="#ffffff">Or in a VIP room.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

204
00:14:23,480 --> 00:14:26,240
<font color="#ffffff">How do we get up there? Who would let us?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

205
00:14:26,320 --> 00:14:28,360
<font color="#ffffff">Right. That's the problem.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

206
00:14:29,200 --> 00:14:31,760
<font color="#ffffff"><i>How's the internship going?</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

207
00:14:31,840 --> 00:14:34,000
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, so far so good.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

208
00:14:34,760 --> 00:14:36,120
<font color="#ffffff">Hey, what drink is that?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

209
00:14:36,200 --> 00:14:37,480
<font color="#ffffff">The color looks weird.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

210
00:14:37,560 --> 00:14:39,640
<font color="#ffffff">The kitchen said it's black plum juice.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

211
00:14:39,720 --> 00:14:41,520
<font color="#ffffff">It's a monk's afternoon drink.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

212
00:14:41,600 --> 00:14:44,520
<font color="#ffffff">A monk's drink? Where are you taking it?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

213
00:14:45,800 --> 00:14:47,200
<font color="#ffffff">The VIP floor.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

214
00:14:48,040 --> 00:14:49,640
<font color="#ffffff">The boss's floor?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

215
00:14:49,720 --> 00:14:50,920
<font color="#ffffff">Yes.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

216
00:14:51,000 --> 00:14:53,000
<font color="#ffffff">Looks like Ms. Yok has a guest monk today.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

217
00:14:53,080 --> 00:14:54,400
<font color="#ffffff">A monk?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

218
00:14:55,640 --> 00:14:57,600
<font color="#ffffff">Okay. Hurry up.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

219
00:15:03,800 --> 00:15:08,360
<font color="#ffffff">USE STAIRS FOR ONE FLOOR</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

220
00:15:12,880 --> 00:15:14,760
<font color="#ffffff">Hey, hold on.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

221
00:15:15,600 --> 00:15:17,960
<font color="#ffffff">-Can we get in?</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Sure, come on in.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

222
00:15:23,080 --> 00:15:24,440
<font color="#ffffff">Which floor?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

223
00:15:24,520 --> 00:15:26,000
<font color="#ffffff">Go ahead, buddy.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

224
00:15:42,960 --> 00:15:44,600
<font color="#ffffff">I'm delivering something to Luang Pho.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

225
00:15:45,200 --> 00:15:46,480
<font color="#ffffff">Who the hell are you?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

226
00:15:48,040 --> 00:15:49,520
<font color="#ffffff">Well…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

227
00:15:49,600 --> 00:15:50,840
<font color="#ffffff">I…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

228
00:15:51,720 --> 00:15:53,200
<font color="#ffffff">Are you the new intern?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

229
00:15:54,680 --> 00:15:57,640
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, I'm the new intern.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

230
00:15:58,320 --> 00:16:01,120
<font color="#ffffff">Okay, give it to me. I'll take it in.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

231
00:16:09,440 --> 00:16:13,520
<font color="#ffffff">Your disciple!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">He's here to help us, Luang Pho!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

232
00:16:19,440 --> 00:16:20,480
<font color="#ffffff">You…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

233
00:16:27,640 --> 00:16:28,560
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

234
00:16:30,120 --> 00:16:31,040
<font color="#ffffff">Boonrod.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

235
00:16:31,120 --> 00:16:33,920
<font color="#ffffff">I thought I'd never see you again.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

236
00:16:34,000 --> 00:16:36,720
<font color="#ffffff">Hey, don't jinx me. I'm not dead yet.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

237
00:16:36,800 --> 00:16:39,040
<font color="#ffffff">-Oh, right.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-How did you get here?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

238
00:16:39,120 --> 00:16:40,040
<font color="#ffffff">I…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

239
00:16:41,320 --> 00:16:44,000
<font color="#ffffff">He probably teleported here.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">What a question.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

240
00:16:45,960 --> 00:16:47,960
<font color="#ffffff">It's called a greeting, you know?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

241
00:16:48,040 --> 00:16:49,880
<font color="#ffffff">Who are you talking to?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

242
00:16:49,960 --> 00:16:51,320
<font color="#ffffff">Whoever can hear me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

243
00:16:51,400 --> 00:16:52,840
<font color="#ffffff">I can hear you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

244
00:16:52,920 --> 00:16:54,200
<font color="#ffffff">How are you doing?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

245
00:16:54,280 --> 00:16:55,720
<font color="#ffffff">Did they hurt you?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

246
00:16:56,840 --> 00:16:58,520
<font color="#ffffff">They haven't done anything yet.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

247
00:16:59,400 --> 00:17:02,880
<font color="#ffffff">All right, we should hurry and go</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">before the rest of them show up.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

248
00:17:02,960 --> 00:17:05,920
<font color="#ffffff">I've been waiting for this. Let's move!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

249
00:17:06,000 --> 00:17:07,400
<font color="#ffffff">Let's go.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

250
00:17:16,440 --> 00:17:18,280
<font color="#ffffff">Don't worry.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

251
00:17:18,359 --> 00:17:19,680
<font color="#ffffff">We won't hurt you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

252
00:17:19,760 --> 00:17:22,200
<font color="#ffffff">We're just looking for someone.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

253
00:17:22,280 --> 00:17:24,160
<font color="#ffffff">We'll let you go soon. Stop whining.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

254
00:17:27,560 --> 00:17:29,640
<font color="#ffffff">Do you think Boonrod made it inside?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

255
00:17:30,640 --> 00:17:31,840
<font color="#ffffff">From experience?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

256
00:17:32,600 --> 00:17:33,600
<font color="#ffffff">He probably got caught.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

257
00:17:36,720 --> 00:17:39,000
<font color="#ffffff">But he always survives in the end.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

258
00:17:53,080 --> 00:17:54,120
<font color="#ffffff">Where is everyone?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

259
00:17:55,200 --> 00:17:56,520
<font color="#ffffff">Did you send them away?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

260
00:17:56,600 --> 00:17:58,080
<font color="#ffffff">No, I didn't.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

261
00:18:00,800 --> 00:18:02,360
<font color="#ffffff">Maybe</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

262
00:18:02,440 --> 00:18:04,080
<font color="#ffffff">they just know what to do.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

263
00:18:04,960 --> 00:18:06,200
<font color="#ffffff">Whatever.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

264
00:18:07,280 --> 00:18:11,840
<font color="#ffffff">Just make sure nobody disturbs me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

265
00:18:13,120 --> 00:18:14,480
<font color="#ffffff">Understood, Ms. Yok.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

266
00:18:31,040 --> 00:18:33,200
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

267
00:18:43,880 --> 00:18:45,920
<font color="#ffffff">Are you sleeping?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

268
00:18:46,480 --> 00:18:48,120
<font color="#ffffff">So quiet.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

269
00:19:01,360 --> 00:19:03,360
<font color="#ffffff">Were you waiting for me?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

270
00:19:11,320 --> 00:19:12,160
<font color="#ffffff">Ms. Yok!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

271
00:19:13,920 --> 00:19:15,360
<font color="#ffffff">Ms. Yok!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

272
00:19:15,440 --> 00:19:17,600
<font color="#ffffff">Ms. Yok! What happened?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

273
00:19:17,680 --> 00:19:19,000
<font color="#ffffff">Why are you in here?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

274
00:19:19,080 --> 00:19:20,000
<font color="#ffffff">Where is he?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

275
00:19:20,080 --> 00:19:22,400
<font color="#ffffff">Where is Luang Pho Suea? Where did he go?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

276
00:19:33,440 --> 00:19:34,520
<font color="#ffffff">This way.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

277
00:19:36,000 --> 00:19:37,120
<font color="#ffffff">Hey, guys!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

278
00:19:37,200 --> 00:19:38,280
<font color="#ffffff">Noona!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

279
00:19:39,120 --> 00:19:40,040
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

280
00:19:41,720 --> 00:19:43,960
<font color="#ffffff">Noona and Saranya…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

281
00:19:44,560 --> 00:19:47,160
<font color="#ffffff">-They're here too?</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-No time to talk.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

282
00:19:47,240 --> 00:19:49,240
<font color="#ffffff">Let's go, move!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

283
00:19:49,320 --> 00:19:50,640
<font color="#ffffff">Stop right there!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

284
00:19:50,720 --> 00:19:53,480
<font color="#ffffff">Hey, don't shoot!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">You'll frighten the guests!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

285
00:19:55,400 --> 00:19:56,880
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho, this way, quick!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

286
00:20:08,320 --> 00:20:09,560
<font color="#ffffff">Saranya, move!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

287
00:20:14,880 --> 00:20:16,280
<font color="#ffffff">Hurry up!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

288
00:20:19,960 --> 00:20:21,640
<font color="#ffffff">Get in the car, quick!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

289
00:20:30,160 --> 00:20:32,520
<font color="#ffffff">NORTHERN NEWS CENTER</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

290
00:20:59,680 --> 00:21:00,760
<font color="#ffffff">What?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

291
00:21:01,280 --> 00:21:02,400
<font color="#ffffff">Who are they?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

292
00:21:02,480 --> 00:21:06,480
<font color="#ffffff">Who dares to kidnap someone on my turf?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

293
00:21:07,080 --> 00:21:08,160
<font color="#ffffff">We don't know.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

294
00:21:08,240 --> 00:21:09,440
<font color="#ffffff">There were three people.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

295
00:21:09,520 --> 00:21:11,280
<font color="#ffffff">Then go find out!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

296
00:21:11,880 --> 00:21:12,840
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, ma'am.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

297
00:21:15,800 --> 00:21:17,160
<font color="#ffffff">These idiots!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

298
00:21:19,960 --> 00:21:21,800
<font color="#ffffff">-Ms. Yok.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-What now?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

299
00:21:21,880 --> 00:21:24,560
<font color="#ffffff">The police are back with a search warrant.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

300
00:21:26,200 --> 00:21:27,600
<font color="#ffffff">What should we do?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

301
00:21:27,680 --> 00:21:28,880
<font color="#ffffff">What do you think?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

302
00:21:28,960 --> 00:21:31,600
<font color="#ffffff">Let them search! What a stupid question.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

303
00:21:32,160 --> 00:21:33,360
<font color="#ffffff">Damn it!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

304
00:21:41,440 --> 00:21:44,320
<font color="#ffffff">How could you let them take the monk away?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

305
00:21:44,400 --> 00:21:46,160
<font color="#ffffff">Stop nagging.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

306
00:21:46,240 --> 00:21:47,680
<font color="#ffffff">I'm stressed enough as it is.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

307
00:21:49,000 --> 00:21:51,120
<font color="#ffffff">You were so confident</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

308
00:21:51,200 --> 00:21:52,680
<font color="#ffffff">your method</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

309
00:21:52,760 --> 00:21:55,520
<font color="#ffffff">would make him talk.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

310
00:21:55,600 --> 00:21:57,960
<font color="#ffffff">Who would've thought it would fail?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

311
00:22:00,160 --> 00:22:02,200
<font color="#ffffff">Because you underestimated him.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

312
00:22:02,960 --> 00:22:05,720
<font color="#ffffff">He's not like the men you're used to.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

313
00:22:06,360 --> 00:22:07,880
<font color="#ffffff"><i>He's a monk!</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

314
00:22:27,040 --> 00:22:30,480
<font color="#ffffff">I've checked everyone and every room,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">including the private floor.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

315
00:22:31,120 --> 00:22:33,920
<font color="#ffffff">No sign of Luang Pho being locked up here.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

316
00:22:34,520 --> 00:22:35,760
<font color="#ffffff">I think</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

317
00:22:35,840 --> 00:22:37,480
<font color="#ffffff">we got it wrong.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

318
00:22:38,360 --> 00:22:39,400
<font color="#ffffff">I checked my side too.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

319
00:22:39,480 --> 00:22:40,360
<font color="#ffffff">And found nothing.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

320
00:22:52,160 --> 00:22:53,800
<font color="#ffffff">Let's head back then. Move.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

321
00:23:01,040 --> 00:23:03,040
<font color="#ffffff">Ms. Yok's secretary called me in.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

322
00:23:04,400 --> 00:23:06,720
<font color="#ffffff">If I talk about the guest attacking me,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

323
00:23:06,800 --> 00:23:08,120
<font color="#ffffff">she'll fire me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

324
00:23:09,360 --> 00:23:11,800
<font color="#ffffff">They're scared of ruining</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">the hotel's reputation<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

325
00:23:11,880 --> 00:23:13,320
<font color="#ffffff">if people find out there was a robbery.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

326
00:23:18,000 --> 00:23:19,840
<font color="#ffffff">But man, you're so unlucky.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

327
00:23:19,920 --> 00:23:22,000
<font color="#ffffff">You were just delivering</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">a beverage to a monk.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

328
00:23:27,440 --> 00:23:28,800
<font color="#ffffff">Totally jinxed, man.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

329
00:23:29,800 --> 00:23:31,360
<font color="#ffffff">I can't even talk about it.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

330
00:23:31,440 --> 00:23:34,120
<font color="#ffffff">It's fine. You survived.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">That's what matters.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

331
00:23:34,200 --> 00:23:35,560
<font color="#ffffff">Hang in there.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

332
00:23:35,640 --> 00:23:36,960
<font color="#ffffff">See you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

333
00:23:50,720 --> 00:23:53,480
<font color="#ffffff">Ms. Ya really did book a room.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

334
00:23:56,680 --> 00:23:57,960
<font color="#ffffff">I'm a police officer.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

335
00:23:59,560 --> 00:24:01,080
<font color="#ffffff">Everything you say</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

336
00:24:01,800 --> 00:24:03,080
<font color="#ffffff">will be kept confidential.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

337
00:24:06,840 --> 00:24:10,280
<font color="#ffffff">I was bringing a drink</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">to Ms. Yok's private floor.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

338
00:24:11,800 --> 00:24:13,960
<font color="#ffffff">I heard she invited a monk over.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

339
00:24:15,520 --> 00:24:18,200
<font color="#ffffff">But while in the elevator</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">with three guests,<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

340
00:24:18,800 --> 00:24:21,400
<font color="#ffffff">they suddenly tied me up</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">in the storage room<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

341
00:24:22,040 --> 00:24:23,360
<font color="#ffffff">and took all my clothes.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

342
00:24:25,560 --> 00:24:26,560
<font color="#ffffff">Three people?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

343
00:24:27,240 --> 00:24:28,480
<font color="#ffffff">Correct.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

344
00:24:28,560 --> 00:24:30,520
<font color="#ffffff">Two women and one man.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

345
00:24:33,600 --> 00:24:34,520
<font color="#ffffff">Which room?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

346
00:24:36,240 --> 00:24:37,600
<font color="#ffffff">They have already left.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

347
00:24:37,680 --> 00:24:38,840
<font color="#ffffff">What?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

348
00:24:38,920 --> 00:24:40,040
<font color="#ffffff">They're gone?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

349
00:24:43,240 --> 00:24:46,960
<font color="#ffffff">That's very strange.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">They didn't even stay the night.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

