00:39:32,600 --> 00:39:33,800
<font color="#ffffff">You got it, sir.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

526
00:39:41,240 --> 00:39:43,640
<font color="#ffffff">You still dare show your face?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

527
00:39:44,400 --> 00:39:45,600
<font color="#ffffff">You thief!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

528
00:39:46,280 --> 00:39:48,160
<font color="#ffffff">You're the one who stole my diamond!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

529
00:39:49,000 --> 00:39:50,240
<font color="#ffffff">Your diamond?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

530
00:39:50,320 --> 00:39:51,520
<font color="#ffffff">It belongs to me!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

531
00:39:54,640 --> 00:39:55,880
<font color="#ffffff">Dad, take cover!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

532
00:40:09,080 --> 00:40:10,320
<font color="#ffffff">Watch out, son!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

533
00:40:11,080 --> 00:40:11,920
<font color="#ffffff">I'm on it!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

534
00:40:17,760 --> 00:40:19,320
<font color="#ffffff">Dad, they're escaping!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

535
00:40:19,400 --> 00:40:20,480
<font color="#ffffff">Hey, after them!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

536
00:40:30,800 --> 00:40:31,880
<font color="#ffffff">Damn it!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

537
00:40:37,720 --> 00:40:40,200
<font color="#ffffff">-Fall back! Retreat!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Move!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

538
00:40:40,280 --> 00:40:41,520
<font color="#ffffff">Move!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

539
00:40:52,040 --> 00:40:54,640
<font color="#ffffff">Wayu, check inside.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

540
00:40:54,720 --> 00:40:56,000
<font color="#ffffff">Yes.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

541
00:41:13,360 --> 00:41:15,200
<font color="#ffffff">They're gone.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

542
00:41:15,760 --> 00:41:16,960
<font color="#ffffff">What?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

543
00:41:18,200 --> 00:41:19,400
<font color="#ffffff">Damn it!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

544
00:41:19,480 --> 00:41:20,440
<font color="#ffffff">Sawaeng!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

545
00:41:31,400 --> 00:41:35,640
<font color="#ffffff">NORTHERN NEWS CENTER</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

546
00:41:42,080 --> 00:41:43,440
<font color="#ffffff">Dream!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

547
00:41:43,520 --> 00:41:44,520
<font color="#ffffff">Dream!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

548
00:41:50,000 --> 00:41:51,520
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, Ya!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

549
00:41:52,720 --> 00:41:54,000
<font color="#ffffff">Welcome, Luang Pho.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

550
00:41:54,600 --> 00:41:55,760
<font color="#ffffff">We meet again.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

551
00:41:56,440 --> 00:41:57,920
<font color="#ffffff">Bless you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

552
00:41:58,000 --> 00:41:59,920
<font color="#ffffff">This is my junior colleague.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

553
00:42:00,000 --> 00:42:01,080
<font color="#ffffff">We can trust him.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

554
00:42:01,920 --> 00:42:04,040
<font color="#ffffff">But what's going on?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

555
00:42:04,120 --> 00:42:05,160
<font color="#ffffff">It's so late.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

556
00:42:05,240 --> 00:42:06,880
<font color="#ffffff">We have a bit of a problem.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

557
00:42:06,960 --> 00:42:08,760
<font color="#ffffff">A bit? That’s an understatement.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

558
00:42:08,840 --> 00:42:11,200
<font color="#ffffff">So we came here to hide</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">and plan our next move.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

559
00:42:11,920 --> 00:42:14,160
<font color="#ffffff">Let's talk inside then.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

560
00:42:14,240 --> 00:42:15,160
<font color="#ffffff">Come on in.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

561
00:42:18,160 --> 00:42:19,120
<font color="#ffffff">Let's go.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

562
00:42:24,360 --> 00:42:28,080
<font color="#ffffff">I hope I get a full night's sleep tonight.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

563
00:42:30,920 --> 00:42:33,360
<font color="#ffffff">I've been sleep-deprived for days.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

564
00:42:57,280 --> 00:42:58,560
<font color="#ffffff">Give me the diamond.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

565
00:42:59,560 --> 00:43:00,720
<font color="#ffffff">What diamond?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

566
00:43:01,680 --> 00:43:02,600
<font color="#ffffff">Then you will all die here.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

567
00:43:02,680 --> 00:43:04,120
<font color="#ffffff">No, don't!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

568
00:43:06,400 --> 00:43:08,200
<font color="#ffffff">Run! Let's go!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

569
00:43:09,000 --> 00:43:10,560
<font color="#ffffff">Hey, stop! It's a woman!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

570
00:43:10,640 --> 00:43:12,640
<font color="#ffffff">-Hey! Let me go!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Don't move!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

571
00:43:12,720 --> 00:43:13,800
<font color="#ffffff">Noona!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

572
00:43:13,880 --> 00:43:16,840
<font color="#ffffff">-You bastards, let go!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Get in!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

573
00:43:16,920 --> 00:43:18,360
<font color="#ffffff">Hey, stop right there!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

574
00:43:18,440 --> 00:43:19,800
<font color="#ffffff">-Hey!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Stop shouting!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

575
00:43:27,360 --> 00:43:28,320
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

576
00:43:29,520 --> 00:43:31,160
<font color="#ffffff">It seems</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

577
00:43:31,240 --> 00:43:33,480
<font color="#ffffff">I've stepped on a mine.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

578
00:43:33,560 --> 00:43:34,760
<font color="#ffffff">A mine?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

579
00:43:44,240 --> 00:43:45,440
<font color="#ffffff">Stop!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

580
00:43:58,360 --> 00:43:59,800
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, it's you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

581
00:43:59,880 --> 00:44:01,120
<font color="#ffffff">Are you done bathing?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

582
00:44:01,680 --> 00:44:03,080
<font color="#ffffff">Ya and the others are waiting.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

583
00:44:03,160 --> 00:44:05,640
<font color="#ffffff">I'll go get some food for everyone.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

584
00:44:06,480 --> 00:44:07,720
<font color="#ffffff">Thank you very much.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

585
00:44:07,800 --> 00:44:08,920
<font color="#ffffff">Sure thing.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

586
00:44:23,600 --> 00:44:26,120
<font color="#ffffff">You're here. Are you done bathing?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

587
00:44:26,200 --> 00:44:28,840
<font color="#ffffff">We're just discussing our next move.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

588
00:44:29,720 --> 00:44:32,600
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho thinks we should head to Bangkok</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

589
00:44:32,680 --> 00:44:35,400
<font color="#ffffff">and seek help from a cop he trusts.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

590
00:44:37,920 --> 00:44:40,240
<font color="#ffffff">And I think we should use the media</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

591
00:44:40,800 --> 00:44:42,200
<font color="#ffffff">to expose the whole truth,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

592
00:44:42,960 --> 00:44:44,040
<font color="#ffffff">to save you</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

593
00:44:44,680 --> 00:44:45,680
<font color="#ffffff">and everyone else.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

594
00:44:48,920 --> 00:44:49,800
<font color="#ffffff">I don't agree.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

595
00:44:51,080 --> 00:44:52,480
<font color="#ffffff">Why not?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

596
00:44:56,160 --> 00:44:57,120
<font color="#ffffff">Boonrod.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

597
00:44:58,880 --> 00:45:02,120
<font color="#ffffff">Do you have a better plan?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

598
00:45:02,200 --> 00:45:03,680
<font color="#ffffff">What's your plan?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

599
00:45:07,480 --> 00:45:09,840
<font color="#ffffff">I can't bear to see everyone suffer</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">because of me anymore.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

600
00:45:10,440 --> 00:45:11,440
<font color="#ffffff">I'll turn myself in.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

601
00:45:15,520 --> 00:45:16,680
<font color="#ffffff">Are you crazy?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

602
00:45:17,400 --> 00:45:18,520
<font color="#ffffff">Turn yourself in?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

603
00:45:19,280 --> 00:45:20,720
<font color="#ffffff">Did you forget last time</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

604
00:45:20,800 --> 00:45:23,160
<font color="#ffffff">when you turned yourself in to Sawaeng?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

605
00:45:23,720 --> 00:45:25,040
<font color="#ffffff">Do you want that to happen again?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

606
00:45:27,040 --> 00:45:28,200
<font color="#ffffff">Boonrod.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

607
00:45:30,200 --> 00:45:32,360
<font color="#ffffff">Didn't we already agree that</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

608
00:45:33,040 --> 00:45:35,360
<font color="#ffffff">I would take you</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

609
00:45:35,440 --> 00:45:39,000
<font color="#ffffff">to a trustworthy cop in Bangkok?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

610
00:45:40,040 --> 00:45:41,240
<font color="#ffffff">At this rate,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

611
00:45:41,320 --> 00:45:43,600
<font color="#ffffff">we won't even make it to Bangkok.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

612
00:45:43,680 --> 00:45:46,200
<font color="#ffffff">Or at least, not all of us</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">will make it there alive.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

613
00:45:47,200 --> 00:45:48,440
<font color="#ffffff">Watch your mouth!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

614
00:45:48,520 --> 00:45:49,800
<font color="#ffffff">It's the truth!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

615
00:45:54,840 --> 00:45:55,800
<font color="#ffffff">I'm the one</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

616
00:45:56,360 --> 00:45:57,840
<font color="#ffffff">causing trouble for everyone.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

617
00:45:58,560 --> 00:46:00,040
<font color="#ffffff">If you know that,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

618
00:46:01,440 --> 00:46:02,640
<font color="#ffffff">then just be grateful.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

619
00:46:03,480 --> 00:46:04,800
<font color="#ffffff">Stop making things worse.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

620
00:46:05,560 --> 00:46:07,600
<font color="#ffffff">Turning yourself in</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">is not your only answer.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

621
00:46:10,000 --> 00:46:11,640
<font color="#ffffff">We're in the same boat now.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

622
00:46:12,320 --> 00:46:13,800
<font color="#ffffff">Stop being so annoying!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

623
00:46:28,160 --> 00:46:29,840
<font color="#ffffff">She's just worried about you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

624
00:46:30,600 --> 00:46:31,920
<font color="#ffffff">I'll go check on her.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

625
00:46:43,320 --> 00:46:44,400
<font color="#ffffff">Boonrod.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

626
00:46:47,440 --> 00:46:49,920
<font color="#ffffff">Think this through carefully.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

627
00:46:51,600 --> 00:46:55,040
<font color="#ffffff">Turning yourself in</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">might not be the best way out.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

628
00:47:10,000 --> 00:47:11,040
<font color="#ffffff">Sawaeng!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

629
00:47:11,120 --> 00:47:14,080
<font color="#ffffff">Because of him,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">Chansuek and the monk got away.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

630
00:47:14,160 --> 00:47:15,560
<font color="#ffffff">Don't be too mad.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

631
00:47:15,640 --> 00:47:18,960
<font color="#ffffff">We took down</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">a lot of Sawaeng's men tonight.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

632
00:47:19,040 --> 00:47:21,160
<font color="#ffffff">We haven't lost yet.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

633
00:47:22,080 --> 00:47:24,000
<font color="#ffffff">And our men weren't hurt?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

634
00:47:24,080 --> 00:47:25,200
<font color="#ffffff">How can you say that?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

635
00:47:28,600 --> 00:47:29,920
<font color="#ffffff">That bastard Sawaeng</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

636
00:47:30,000 --> 00:47:32,400
<font color="#ffffff">is a pain in the ass.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

637
00:47:37,200 --> 00:47:38,920
<font color="#ffffff">Someone's waiting to see you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

638
00:47:40,880 --> 00:47:41,880
<font color="#ffffff">Who?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

639
00:47:41,960 --> 00:47:43,800
<font color="#ffffff">See for yourself.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

640
00:47:53,840 --> 00:47:55,040
<font color="#ffffff">Boss!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

641
00:47:56,000 --> 00:47:58,240
<font color="#ffffff">If I really am Chansuek,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

642
00:47:59,000 --> 00:48:00,280
<font color="#ffffff">and you're a reporter,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

643
00:48:00,360 --> 00:48:01,920
<font color="#ffffff">we must've crossed paths.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

644
00:48:02,000 --> 00:48:03,000
<font color="#ffffff">Yes.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

645
00:48:03,600 --> 00:48:04,760
<font color="#ffffff">I know you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

646
00:48:05,360 --> 00:48:07,120
<font color="#ffffff">How did it go? Did you find him?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

647
00:48:07,720 --> 00:48:09,240
<font color="#ffffff">Not a trace, Luang Pho.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

648
00:48:09,320 --> 00:48:11,400
<font color="#ffffff">NEXT EPISODE</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

649
00:48:11,480 --> 00:48:13,880
<font color="#ffffff"><i>You're the only one who can answer me.</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

650
00:48:16,920 --> 00:48:18,840
<font color="#ffffff">You need to help me,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

651
00:48:18,920 --> 00:48:20,560
<font color="#ffffff">otherwise</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

652
00:48:20,640 --> 00:48:22,320
<font color="#ffffff">I'll expose him.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

653
00:48:22,400 --> 00:48:24,400
<font color="#ffffff">Don't do that.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

654
00:48:24,480 --> 00:48:25,920
<font color="#ffffff">You can't do that.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

655
00:48:26,000 --> 00:48:27,720
<font color="#ffffff">Hey, grab him!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

656
00:48:27,800 --> 00:48:28,920
<font color="#ffffff">Wait!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

657
00:48:33,480 --> 00:48:34,320
<font color="#ffffff">Chan,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

658
00:48:34,920 --> 00:48:37,520
<font color="#ffffff">I'm glad you made it back safely.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

659
00:48:41,040 --> 00:48:42,560
<font color="#ffffff">Do we know each other?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

660
00:51:48,320 --> 00:51:53,320
<font color="#ffffff">Subtitle translation by: Jarut K.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>
